{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the Forefront Open Beta, you'll be able to:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a new game mode 'Rush' on our Siberia map, which will include sea-based vehicles for the first time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 'Conquest' on our Iceland map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide cover fire with the new LMG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix up vehicles with the new Engineer tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your class-based loadouts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The full game will feature more maps, full weapons customization, deep progression systems, more vehicles, and much more!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forefront \u2013 The Next Evolution of VR Warfare</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Breachers</strong> and <strong>Hyper Dash</strong>, <strong>Forefront</strong> delivers an <strong>all-out war experience like never before</strong> in VR. Engage in <strong>massive 32-player battles</strong> across a variety of expansive, semi-destructible environments, where strategy, skill, and teamwork decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/63ff2007b9f7f5fa8e070c8c083bc7b5.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/63ff2007b9f7f5fa8e070c8c083bc7b5.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/63ff2007b9f7f5fa8e070c8c083bc7b5.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 <strong>Command land, sea, and air vehicles</strong> \u2013 Pilot helicopters, drive tanks, and storm objectives in humvees and boats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/d75d2173dd70c9d81ffeae676f3d03b7.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/d75d2173dd70c9d81ffeae676f3d03b7.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/d75d2173dd70c9d81ffeae676f3d03b7.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Choose your class</strong> \u2013 Play as Assault, Engineer, Medic, or Sniper, each with specialized weapons and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/ca43231dc3ecda86b41fe7d816627014.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/ca43231dc3ecda86b41fe7d816627014.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/ca43231dc3ecda86b41fe7d816627014.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Feel the impact</strong> \u2013 Realistic gunplay, tactical movement, and large-scale combat bring the battlefield to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/44d503ec6a57bfddb9c3327a09dd7785.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/44d503ec6a57bfddb9c3327a09dd7785.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/44d503ec6a57bfddb9c3327a09dd7785.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Shape the fight</strong> \u2013 Blast through walls, and use destruction to create new paths or deny enemy cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/dd8912f6b08220e14fe749f325728398.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/dd8912f6b08220e14fe749f325728398.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/dd8912f6b08220e14fe749f325728398.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is <strong>2035</strong>. A powerful energy corporation, O.R.E., has built a private military to defend its <strong>monopoly on Red Orpiment, a rare mineral set to power the world</strong>, while local governments and resistance fighters battle to reclaim control. You are the tip of the spear in the war to control it\u2014<strong>which side will you take?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Wishlist now to be the first to fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Join our community:</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039520?t=1760000524","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/8b96edb0e697e32c75e37f4e9e0142299ae860c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760000524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/703b28c4c7b568bb9a0b143beff65f8734601d08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760000524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/703b28c4c7b568bb9a0b143beff65f8734601d08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760000524","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes gun violence and minimal blood effects."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the Forefront Open Beta, you'll be able to:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a new game mode 'Rush' on our Siberia map, which will include sea-based vehicles for the first time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 'Conquest' on our Iceland map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide cover fire with the new LMG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix up vehicles with the new Engineer tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your class-based loadouts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The full game will feature more maps, full weapons customization, deep progression systems, more vehicles, and much more!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forefront \u2013 The Next Evolution of VR Warfare</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Breachers</strong> and <strong>Hyper Dash</strong>, <strong>Forefront</strong> delivers an <strong>all-out war experience like never before</strong> in VR. Engage in <strong>massive 32-player battles</strong> across a variety of expansive, semi-destructible environments, where strategy, skill, and teamwork decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/63ff2007b9f7f5fa8e070c8c083bc7b5.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/63ff2007b9f7f5fa8e070c8c083bc7b5.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/63ff2007b9f7f5fa8e070c8c083bc7b5.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 <strong>Command land, sea, and air vehicles</strong> \u2013 Pilot helicopters, drive tanks, and storm objectives in humvees and boats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/d75d2173dd70c9d81ffeae676f3d03b7.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/d75d2173dd70c9d81ffeae676f3d03b7.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/d75d2173dd70c9d81ffeae676f3d03b7.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Choose your class</strong> \u2013 Play as Assault, Engineer, Medic, or Sniper, each with specialized weapons and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/ca43231dc3ecda86b41fe7d816627014.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/ca43231dc3ecda86b41fe7d816627014.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/ca43231dc3ecda86b41fe7d816627014.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Feel the impact</strong> \u2013 Realistic gunplay, tactical movement, and large-scale combat bring the battlefield to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/44d503ec6a57bfddb9c3327a09dd7785.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/44d503ec6a57bfddb9c3327a09dd7785.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/44d503ec6a57bfddb9c3327a09dd7785.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Shape the fight</strong> \u2013 Blast through walls, and use destruction to create new paths or deny enemy cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/dd8912f6b08220e14fe749f325728398.poster.avif?t=1760000524\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/dd8912f6b08220e14fe749f325728398.webm?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/extras/dd8912f6b08220e14fe749f325728398.mp4?t=1760000524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is <strong>2035</strong>. A powerful energy corporation, O.R.E., has built a private military to defend its <strong>monopoly on Red Orpiment, a rare mineral set to power the world</strong>, while local governments and resistance fighters battle to reclaim control. You are the tip of the spear in the war to control it\u2014<strong>which side will you take?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Wishlist now to be the first to fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Join our community:</strong> </p>","developers":["Triangle Factory"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2981220","name":"Forefront"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039520/3caef637e5d3500ff3eb15111ad0fd351c1f26bf/header.jpg?t=1760000524","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4039520/1863667632/69c41ee3b71a9ecfca621d29dd1916c832725209/1758029722/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759406291","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4039520/1863667632/69c41ee3b71a9ecfca621d29dd1916c832725209/1758029722/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759406291","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4039520/1863667632/69c41ee3b71a9ecfca621d29dd1916c832725209/1758029722/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759406291","id":257198751,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198751/movie480.mp4?t=1759406291","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198751/movie_max.mp4?t=1759406291"},"name":"Forefront Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akam